pulls/114772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114772","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114772.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114772.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-09T16:37:34Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114738\r\n\r\nThere were 2 issues here.\r\nOn symbol lookup click in CodeEdit, the mouse released event never makes it to TextEdit, so the logic that changes the selection mode in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111535 never gets hit.\r\nMoving the caret with the arrow keys or directly with the function never updated the word column, which is now needed.\r\n\r\nThe symbol lookup now falls through to TextEdit.\r\nThe word beg/end columns are now set when the selection origin is updated, which includes `select()`, so it should always be updated by the time they are used in `_update_selection_mode_pointer`. This also covers ones from `_pre_shift_selection` that I removed.\r\n\r\nAdded a few tests, and made the tests in this test case always send a mouse release event to be more accurate to expected behavior.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114772/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}